---
<svg class="food-icon" data-food-icon={name} width={size} height={size} viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path class="food-icon-main" d={icon.main}/><path class="food-icon-detail" d={icon.detail}/></svg>
